===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i|aa=porozumět}}

# {{lb|cs|transitive|with dative}} to [[understand]] {{qualifier|+ [[dative case]]}}
#: {{ux|cs|[[vůbec|Vůbec]] [[tomu]] '''nerozumím'''.|I do not '''understand''' it at all.|inline=1}}
# {{cs-reflexive|d}} to [[go without saying]]
#: {{ux|cs|To '''se rozumí''' samo sebou.|That goes without saying.|inline=1}}
# {{cs-reflexive|i}} to [[understand]] (another person sympathetically); to [[sympathize]] with
#: {{ux|cs|Alena a Petr '''si''' spolu dobře '''rozumí'''.|Alena and Petr '''understand''' each other well.|inline=1}}

